{"id":"778fc116e8b58e57","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md","title":"Boolean-Valued Model","display":"thm-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-boolean-valued-model","aliases":["58-thm-boolean-valued-model","Boolean-Valued Model","$V^B$"],"display":"thm-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-boolean-valued-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-boolean-valued-model</span><span>Boolean-Valued Model</span><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^B\">\\(V^B\\)</span></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87811b9038822859\" href=\"?note=87811b9038822859\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9535688e55559250\" href=\"?note=9535688e55559250\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md\">../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5b7ea7de596a92e\" href=\"?note=e5b7ea7de596a92e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"752f93f666b5f208\" href=\"?note=752f93f666b5f208\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\mathbb B,U,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\mathbb B,U,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, extension, complete Boolean algebra, generic ultrafilter, and order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> (Boolean-valued names and atomic truth values, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"87811b9038822859\" href=\"?note=87811b9038822859\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S\\)</span> (model-relative generic ultrafilter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e5b7ea7de596a92e\" href=\"?note=e5b7ea7de596a92e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BooleanUltrafilterExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BooleanUltrafilterExtension}_S\\)</span> (Boolean-ultrafilter extension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"752f93f666b5f208\" href=\"?note=752f93f666b5f208\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (recursive Boolean-name evaluation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BooleanUltrafilterExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb B,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists Q,E,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nQ=\\{[\\sigma]_U:\\sigma\\in M\\land\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad [\\sigma]_U=\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\llbracket\\sigma=\\tau\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\{\\langle[\\sigma]_U,[\\tau]_U\\rangle\\in Q^2:\n\\llbracket\\sigma\\in\\tau\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,Q,N)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\to\n\\exists x\\in N\\;(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,U,\\mathbb B)\n\\land\\pi([\\sigma]_U)=x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\pi(a)\\in\\pi(b)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BooleanUltrafilterExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb B,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists Q,E,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nQ=\\{[\\sigma]_U:\\sigma\\in M\\land\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad [\\sigma]_U=\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\llbracket\\sigma=\\tau\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\{\\langle[\\sigma]_U,[\\tau]_U\\rangle\\in Q^2:\n\\llbracket\\sigma\\in\\tau\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,Q,N)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\to\n\\exists x\\in N\\;(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,U,\\mathbb B)\n\\land\\pi([\\sigma]_U)=x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\pi(a)\\in\\pi(b)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient uses only Boolean-valued names belonging to the set ground model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; no set is identified with the proper class of all Boolean names.</li>\n<li>Equality modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>, quotient membership, and the valuation map are all explicit. Genericity is essential for the valuation map to be a surjective membership isomorphism onto <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"87811b9038822859","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md","status":"resolved","id":"9535688e55559250","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5b7ea7de596a92e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing3-generic-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"752f93f666b5f208","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing5-boolean-ultrafilter-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"87811b9038822859","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S$ and $\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathbb B}$